StudyHub is a web application where students can upload and share study materials like notes, PDFs, and links.

Built using:

HTML
Bootstrap
JavaScript
Node.js
Express.js
MongoDB


## Features
User Signup & Login
Upload PDFs, Notes, and Links
View shared resources
Search resources
Delete resources
Admin access
File upload support


## Technologies Used

#Frontend
HTML
Bootstrap
JavaScript

#Backend
Node.js
Express.js
Database
MongoDB

## Install Packages
npm install

## Start MongoDB
mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/studyhub

## Run Server
node server.js


